{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>萬聖節前夕（10 月 31 日），中環蘭桂坊「鬼影幢幢」，晚上八時，市民要排隊約一小時，才能進入核心的酒吧區，人人扮鬼扮馬，歡度佳節。港鐵中環站的部分出入口暫時關閉，警方指中環蘭桂坊一帶較擠迫，呼籲市民考慮轉往其他地方。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"719\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2026-10-31-at-19.05.23-1-1024x719.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2026-10-31-at-19.47.11-3-1024x750.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"730\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2026-10-31-at-19.05.22-5-1024x730.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"652\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2026-10-31-at-19.05.22-7-1024x652.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"772\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2026-10-31-at-19.05.23-3-1024x772.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"713\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2026-10-31-at-19.47.11-1-1024x713.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2026-10-31-at-19.05.23-2-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2026-10-31-at-19.47.11-1024x750.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"